** YOTSPOT TOP TIP
------------------------------------------------------------


** DO YOU NEED A BACKGROUND CHECK TO APPLY FOR JOBS?
------------------------------------------------------------

No, you don't need a background check or CrewPass verification to apply for jobs on Yotspot.

Simply complete the Background Check section of your profile and click Save. If you don't have one, select “No, I don't have.”

CrewPass verification is optional.
CHECK YOUR PROFILE (https://www.yotspot.com/my-account/profile/background-check.html)


